**.idea/

# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
**target/

# Remove Cargo.lock from gitignore if creating an executable, leave it for libraries
# More information here https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html
**Cargo.lock

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk


# Added by cargo

/target
Cargo.lock
**.claude/
docs/

# `cargo xtask codegen` commit machinery: an OS advisory lock file beside
# the permanent-id ledger, and the staged temporaries both generated
# artifacts are written to before being renamed into place. Neither is
# ever part of a commit; a stray staged file means a run died mid-commit.
colorthief-dataset/assets/color_ids.csv.lock
**/*.staged-*
